"The kanto, given the setting it deserved.": "Ang kanto, binigyan na ng lugar na deserve nito.",
"Every Filipino who grew up in the 90s remembers the kanto: the sari-sari store bench, the Sunday-morning pandesal run, the barkada that gathered under a streetlight with nothing to do and nowhere better to be. That corner was where friendships were made. It was never comfortable, and it was never designed. It just worked.": "Lahat ng Pinoy na lumaki noong 90s, tanda pa ang kanto: yung bench sa tapat ng sari-sari store, yung pandesal run tuwing Sunday morning, yung barkadang tumatambay sa ilalim ng poste kahit walang ginagawa. Doon nabuo ang mga friendship. Hindi siya comfortable at hindi siya dinesign. Pero gumana.",
"Nuvìnta Cafe by Totoy Brown Tambayan takes that culture and gives it the setting it always deserved. It is an outdoor specialty coffee shop that pairs well-made espresso and thoughtful design with the sounds, flavors and objects of a 90s Filipino childhood. The name says it plainly: Nuvìnta means New Vintage.": "Kinukuha ng Nuvìnta Cafe by Totoy Brown Tambayan ang culture na yan at binibigyan ng setting na matagal na nitong deserve. Outdoor specialty coffee shop siya na pinagsasama ang solid na espresso at maayos na design sa mga tunog, lasa at gamit ng 90s na kabataang Pinoy. Simple lang ang pangalan: ang Nuvìnta ay New Vintage.",
"What sets Nuvìnta apart is that the nostalgia is playable. Guests can race Mini 4WD cars on a Tamiya track, battle in Beyblade and Crush Gear arenas, shoot hoops on an arcade basketball machine, or settle into a retro lounge where Slam Dunk, Ghost Fighter and Flame of Recca play all day. They don't just look at the 90s. They play in it, stay longer, order more and come back with their barkada.": "Ang kakaiba sa Nuvìnta, nalalaro ang nostalgia. Pwedeng mag-race ng Mini 4WD sa Tamiya track, mag-battle sa Beyblade at Crush Gear arena, mag-shoot sa arcade basketball, o mag-chill sa retro lounge kung saan buong araw ang Slam Dunk, Ghost Fighter at Flame of Recca. Hindi lang nila tinitingnan ang 90s. Nilalaro nila, mas tumatagal sila, mas umoorder, at bumabalik kasama ang barkada.",
