"Customers now know the difference between a flat white and a 3-in-1, and increasingly seek local beans like Batangas Barako, Benguet and Sagada Arabica.": "Alam na ng customers ang difference ng flat white at 3-in-1, at mas hinahanap na ang local beans gaya ng Batangas Barako, Benguet at Sagada Arabica.",
"Outdoor spaces are preferred.": "Mas gusto ang outdoor.",
"Since the pandemic, open-air venues feel safer and more relaxed, and garden cafes have become weekend destinations in their own right.": "Since pandemic, mas safe at relaxed ang feeling sa open-air, at naging weekend destination na ang garden cafes.",
"The \"third place\" is missing.": "Kulang ang \"third place.\"",
"Malls are crowded and chains feel interchangeable. There is clear demand for a local, characterful place to linger between home and work.": "Siksikan sa mall at pare-pareho ang chains. Kitang-kita na hinahanap ang local at may character na lugar na matatambayan between bahay at work.",
"Experiences beat products.": "Mas panalo ang experience kaysa produkto.",
"Customers increasingly choose venues that offer an activity along with food and drink. Classic 90s toys still have active collector and hobby communities, and Beyblade and Mini 4WD keep drawing new players, so the play zones serve both returning fans and newcomers.": "Mas pinipili na ng customers ang lugar na may activity bukod sa food and drinks. May active pa ring collector at hobby communities ang classic 90s toys, at tuloy-tuloy ang bagong players ng Beyblade at Mini 4WD, kaya pang-OG fans at newbies ang play zones.",
